<!--
  Small icon for the Scout tracking notification.

  A dedicated asset rather than reusing ic_launcher_foreground: Android renders a notification's
  small icon as a SILHOUETTE from its alpha channel only, discarding colour. The launcher foreground
  is a full-colour, mostly-opaque square, so it would show up as a featureless blob. This is the
  standard "my location" crosshair as a white-on-transparent glyph, which is what the silhouette
  treatment expects.
-->
